# Only shell scripts are pinned here, and only because bash cannot run them
# with CRLF: `set -uo pipefail\r` is not a valid builtin invocation.
#
# This is deliberately the ONLY rule. The MoonBit sources keep whatever line
# endings the formatter produced, and forcing them to LF here would rewrite
# files for no gain while making `moon fmt --check` diffs unreadable. When a
# .mbt file ever needs a fixed ending, add that rule here explicitly rather
# than adding a blanket `* text=auto`.
*.sh text eol=lf